  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 212.03 Filing Deadlines. The filing deadlines for an appeal of an assessment of a residence located in an industrial or commercial zone shall be as stated in RSA 75:11 and RSA 75:14.\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 216.03); ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
